.TH "TODOPRO ENCRYPTION ROTATE-KEY" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro encryption rotate-key Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-encryption\-rotate-key \- [Discontinued] Rotate an E2EE key (ADR-0024).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro encryption rotate-key
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
[Discontinued] Rotate an E2EE key (ADR-0024).
.PP
E2EE has been dropped as a shipped feature. Key rotation was never
implemented and will not be — there is no key to rotate.
See `docs/adr/ADR-0024-drop-e2ee.md`.
